# Deploy to igiligil.xyz immediately

After finishing any change, addition, or removal the user requested:

1. Commit only the relevant files. Never commit `.env`, secrets, or `supabase/.temp/`.
2. Fast-forward or merge into `master` and push `origin/master` so Vercel updates https://www.igiligil.xyz and https://igiligil.xyz.
3. Verify the live page (hard refresh if the CDN is stale) before saying it is online.
4. Do not wait for the user to ask for commit, push, or deploy.

Do not force-push `master`.
